# ai-dev-workflow — copy to .env (repo root; the Next.js frontend and the Python agent both
# load this one file). This is the whole file: every other configuration value lives in the
# config vault as a secret and is injected at boot. Variable catalog: docs/CONFIG.md; mechanism,
# seeding and role grant: README.md "Configuration from Key Vault". Dev vault: aidw-kv-dev.
# Anything set here or in the shell wins over the vault. Never commit .env.
AZURE_CONFIG_VAULT_URI=https://<vault>.vault.azure.net/
